    "building": {
      "word": "BUILDING",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "The act of constructing, erecting, or establishing. Hence it is that the building of our Sion rises no faster. Bp. Hall.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "The art of constructing edifices, or the practice of civil architecture. The execution of works of architecture necessarily includes building; but building is frequently employed when the result is not architectural. Hosking.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "That which is built; a fabric or edifice constructed, as a house, a church, etc. Thy sumptuous buildings and thy wife's attire Have cost a mass of public treasury. Shak.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        }
      ],
