    "built": {
      "word": "BUILT",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "Shape; build; form of structure; as, the built of a ship.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "Formed; shaped; constructed; made; -- often used in composition and preceded by the word denoting the form; as, frigate-built, clipper-built, etc. Like the generality of Genoese countrywomen, strongly built. Landor.",
